{"id":"nvme-show-hostnqn.1","n":"nvme-show-hostnqn","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"nvme-cli","ver":"2.11-7.el9_6","repo":"BaseOS","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/BaseOS/x86_64/os/Packages/n/nvme-cli-2.11-7.el9_6.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/nvme-show-hostnqn.1.gz","sha256":"71fe6ccbf043abacd93f174504a22ab0ddc790e77ce9a36c82f3f84a3f5aa6df","date":"10/14/2025","origin":"NVMe"},"u":{"pkg":"nvme-cli","ver":"1.16-3ubuntu0.3","repo":"jammy-updates/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/n/nvme-cli/nvme-cli_1.16-3ubuntu0.3_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/nvme-show-hostnqn.1.gz","sha256":"dcf48dfd7b6ac0ec2718aa28ab18401c31be99cf7c144791f8fccb89f72860a2","date":"11/11/2021","origin":"NVMe"}},"nopt":{"r":2,"u":0},"desc":"Show the host NQN configured for the system","same":false,"r":[["NAME","<p>nvme-show-hostnqn - Show the host NQN configured for the system</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<pre><i>nvme show-hostnqn</i> [--output-format=&lt;fmt&gt; | -o &lt;fmt&gt;] [--verbose | -v]</pre>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>Show the host NQN configured for the system. If /etc/nvme/hostnqn is not present and systemd application-specific machine IDs are available, this will show the systemd-generated host NQN for the system.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<dl><dt data-o=\"\">-o &lt;fmt&gt;, --output-format=&lt;fmt&gt;</dt><dd>Set the reporting format to <i>normal</i>, <i>json</i> or <i>binary</i>. Only one output format can be used at a time.</dd></dl> <dl><dt data-o=\"\">-v, --verbose</dt><dd>Increase the information detail in the output.</dd></dl>"],["EXAMPLES","<p>nvme show-hostnqn</p>"],["NVME","<p>Part of the nvme-user suite</p>"]],"u":[["NAME","<p>nvme-show-hostnqn - Generate a host NVMe Qualified Name</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<pre><i>nvme show-hostnqn</i></pre>"],["DESCRIPTION",2],["OPTIONS","<p>No options needed</p>"],["EXAMPLES",4],["NVME",5]],"diff":{"r":["--output-format","--verbose","-o","-v"],"u":[]}}